Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 20:55:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Nepali translate toggle (Google Translate) to the Canon
 nav bar
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New investors-canon/js/translate.js: a 'नेपाली' button in the header
  nav sets the googtrans cookie (/en/ne) and reloads; the hidden Google
  Translate element then renders the whole page in Nepali. Clicking
  again ('EN') clears the cookie and returns to English. Choice
  persists across pages via the cookie.
- Button injected into all 4 hub pages and all 121 chapter pages;
  build-book.py template updated so book.html gets it too.
- CSS: styled to match the existing print/audio nav buttons; Google's
  own banner/tooltip chrome hidden so the site layout is untouched.
